<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">04082026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Twenty vessels crossed the Bab el-Mandeb strait on Monday — a number essentially unchanged, and it quietly contradicts both governments now claiming to control the sea lanes of the Gulf.</s> <s>Only six ships used Hormuz, because a strait is never simply open or closed... it's priced, and the war-risk premium is what actually rations who sails.</s> <s>The shipowners are the only party here with money on the answer, and they've priced neither a settlement nor a closure.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Washington says it fully controls the Strait of Hormuz and that talks with Tehran began Monday; Iran says it's negotiating only with Oman, over a shipping corridor.</s> <s>Muscat has spent decades as the region's quiet intermediary, and indirect mediation exists precisely because it lets both sides concede things that would be politically fatal said face to face.</s> <s>Oman's already rejected Iran's single-corridor proposal, and Tehran's foreign ministry hasn't closed the gap between the two accounts.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Ukraine's president dismissed his ambassador to Washington while she's under investigation by the country's own anti-corruption bureau — without any formal charge against her.</s> <s>That bureau, known as <sub alias="NABU">NABU</sub>, was built at Western insistence as a condition of aid, and every attempt to pull it back under presidential control since twenty-fifteen has triggered a donor backlash.</s> <s>Wartime states concentrate power for reasons everyone accepts... and the accountability machinery is always the first thing that concentration reaches.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In south Lebanon, Israel warned Nadia Arnaout by text message, then struck her home.</s> <s>More than one point two million Lebanese have fled the south, and the cessation arrangement of November twenty twenty-four required no withdrawal on any enforceable schedule — it left five positions held pending conditions only one party certifies.</s> <s>Nadia and Marvet rebuilt anyway, unsure how long the house will stand.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nineteen Palestinians were killed in Gaza within days of a disarmament framework signed on the thirty-first of July.</s> <s>The agreement requires phased disarmament by Hamas and phased Israeli withdrawal, but no clause binds the interval before either step begins — the gap between signature and obligation is where the deaths are happening.</s> <s>Gaza's health ministry counts one hundred fifty-two dead this month, and no enforcement mechanism exists.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Shelling struck the town of Shererina in Ethiopia's Tigray region after four years without open fighting.</s> <s>The Pretoria agreement of twenty twenty-two disarmed no one and left Eritrea — the war's other belligerent — outside the text entirely, which is why a ceasefire between two of three armed parties decays rather than holds.</s> <s>Hundreds fled toward Raya Kobo as federal forces sealed the roads around Humera, where Ethiopia, Sudan and Eritrea meet.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A community in northeastern Nigeria is writing down its own language for the first time.</s> <s>Between eight and eleven thousand people speak Kam, and before twenty-sixteen no researcher had ever recorded it — a language isn't lost when its speakers die, it's lost when no institution ever thought it worth documenting.</s> <s>A Berlin linguist trained fourteen community members to do the work themselves, and half of Nigeria's five hundred-plus languages remain undocumented.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Since El Salvador opened its mega-prison, sixteen more have been proposed across ten Latin American countries.</s> <s>Mass arrests under a state of emergency skip individual hearings, so the exception is cheap to declare and the custody becomes a permanent line in the budget.</s> <s>San Salvador has renewed its emergency decree for fifty-two consecutive months.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Jamaat-i-Islami says Pakistan's government collected one point nine trillion rupees through the petroleum levy last year, and plans to block the Indus Highway and the Bab-i-Khyber crossing on Friday.</s> <s>A levy isn't a tax — it sits outside the pool shared with the provinces, it can be raised by notification rather than budget vote, and it's collected from people with no filing obligation at all.</s> <s>That's what politics looks like when a price rises without a vote, and the levy's whole design is that there's no vote to lose.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Romania blasted rock from a riverbed to keep a reactor cooling as the Danube ran low and hot.</s> <s>Reactors dump most of their waste heat into river water, so a warm, shallow river forces a shutdown long before any nuclear limit is reached — drought, not the atom, is the binding constraint.</s> <s>Hungary's last turbine at Paks is holding two hundred forty megawatts, with a full shutdown expected.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Telangana launched India's first ethanol-powered electric vehicle charger, reforming the fuel into electricity on site.</s> <s>What it removes is the point: a fast charger draws more power than most street feeders can supply, and upgrading that feeder is a utility project with a multi-year queue this design simply skips.</s> <s>Installation takes seventy-two hours — though the vehicle is now, in effect, burning a crop, and the carbon case depends entirely on what grew it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Europe's answer to the reusable rocket lost thirty-seven and a half million euros, pushing its equity below zero.</s> <s>French company law then forced its parent, ArianeGroup, to formally vote on dissolving MaiaSpace — the conflict isn't engineering, it's that the shareholder still profits from the expendable rocket the new vehicle would replace.</s> <s>ArianeGroup voted to continue, targeting a first orbital flight in late twenty twenty-seven, God willing.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Uzbekistan's first reactor unit arrives in twenty twenty-nine at Jizzakh.</s> <s>Small modular reactors need far less capital up front, which lets grids and treasuries too small for a full-scale plant go nuclear at all.</s> <s>Uzbekistan would become the first country in Central Asia with an operating nuclear plant.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A spent SpaceX rocket stage strikes the Moon on Wednesday, near Einstein crater, at roughly eight thousand seven hundred kilometres an hour.</s> <s>The stage has drifted since a launch in January twenty twenty-five, and South Korea's Danuri orbiter will film the impact as it carves a fresh crater.</s> <s>Scientists still can't say who governs lunar debris, or who'd be liable if the next one hit something that mattered.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Two people in Michigan have died of cyclosporiasis — the first recorded deaths ever from the parasite.</s> <s>Cyclospora oocysts must mature in soil or water for days before they can infect anyone, which is why every outbreak traces back to contaminated produce rather than person-to-person spread.</s> <s>Lettuce served at a fast-food chain is the suspected source, and more than eleven thousand cases are now confirmed nationwide.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers tested fifty-one language measures used to detect psychosis across more than one language.</s> <s>Coherence scores lean on word-embedding models trained on a single language's corpus, so the same number can mean entirely different things depending on who's speaking — a diagnostic tool that travels badly.</s> <s>Simple word-count measures outperformed the sophisticated ones.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Telegram vanished from Apple's App Store worldwide, then returned — and neither company has explained either event.</s> <s>Outside the European Union's jurisdiction, iOS permits no other route to install an app, so a delisting isn't a store decision, it's a functional ban that also stops security fixes from shipping.</s> <s>Telegram is civic and commercial infrastructure across Iran, Central Asia and much of the Arab world, and a silent decision in Cupertino is an outage in Tashkent with no route of appeal.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A leaked internal guide from the surveillance firm Flock instructs police departments to own the narrative before city council hearings.</s> <s>The vendor can't lobby a council as effectively as the police chief can, because the chief appears as the council's own neutral expert — so the playbook makes the body doing the oversight dependent on the company being overseen.</s> <s>A former salesman who quit says each local camera system he pitched becomes searchable across a national network, not just by the city that bought it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Minnesota reported attacks on more than thirty water systems, and the <sub alias="F B I">FBI</sub> says seven states saw degraded operations.</s> <s>American water utilities are thousands of small municipal operators running control systems never designed to face the internet — so a state actor and a stranger scanning for exposed equipment produce identical early evidence.</s> <s>Investigators are probing an Iran link with no public evidence naming anyone, and attribution during wartime is a policy instrument as much as a finding.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Mexico's largest university will make fifty-eight thousand applicants retake its entrance exam in person.</s> <s>The proportion scoring one hundred or more jumped from three and a half percent to sixteen point three — but the artificial-intelligence proctor flagged deviations like a second face or a dropped connection, not proven cheating.</s> <s>Tens of thousands now carry the consequence of a system that measured anomalies and called them dishonesty.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>